<title>POLAND: Polish shares close flat in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close flat in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of all four companies traded in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday closed flat in increased turnover, which rose to 241,700 zlotys from 145,600 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Debica did not trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 7.5 percent in 5.5-million zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
